WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.160
no hay pinturas

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.160
in the container.

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.160
Instead, we found

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.480
bags full of drugs

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.400
and a map

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.040
marking a border crossing point.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.200
I don't understand what it all means.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.160
Oh, really?

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.360
Well, I do.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.280
Your container

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.560
is a smuggler's paradise.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.840
Do you understand that?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.120
No!

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.200
That has to be a misunderstanding.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.640
So you're telling me...

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.120
Yes, sir.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.200
Mrs. Aspen,

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.080
you're free to go.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.040
Thank the man

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.280
who pulled some strings for you.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.160
All the way from the top.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:51.800
Who?
